# Local development environment
#
# The live site's data (products, services, testimonials, blogs) is stored in
# a CMS (Strapi), not in this repo. Without these two lines set, every page
# that pulls from the CMS will render empty locally (product carousel,
# testimonials, products page, services page, blogs).
#
# To fix: copy this file to .env.local (same folder), then restart the dev
# server (stop it with Ctrl+C, run `npm run dev` again). No values need to
# be changed — the URLs below already point at the live site's API.

NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://www.vmetalsolutions.com/api
API_URL=https://www.vmetalsolutions.com/api
